/-!
# The literal matrix beta-II density

This is density (19), with both real degrees in their full admissible ranges.
The exact Wishart/inverse-Wishart joint density factors as the beta-II density
in `X` times an inverse-Wishart density in `Y`, including its normalization
constants. The zero-dimensional endpoint is retained explicitly.
-/

open Matrix MeasureTheory TauCeti TauCeti.Probability WishartVerification
